(what I did) The probe is `holes/labs/M-diagramprover/flow_23519_agency_probe.clj` (commit `7c1bda7f`). It writes each turn as Agency events:
- your turns are requests to me;
- my 🈸 paragraphs are questions to you;
- the codex-10 request is a request to codex-10, which publishes the narration that C3 reads.

previous_reply_acts.text:
(glyphs as types, and where Agency comes in) The Agency skeleton (`skeleton/agency.clj`) already has the typing half for bells:
- a bell is a linear wire from the ring to its answer;
- answering twice is `:duplicated`;
- answering a bell that was never received is `:ill-typed`;
- an unanswered bell is an open output port.
